    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "E-li-yaa kɛnɛ kuäär ni Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr li̱eth Ɛ̈-ɣab, cua Mo-ab lɔ̱ɔ̱ la̱t kɛ kui̱ I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ cu Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa pɛ̈ɛ̈n guäth nyuurädɛ duëël nhial kä Tha-mɛ-ria, kä cuɛ cu tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ juey. Kä cuɛ naath ja̱k jio̱kɛ kɛ i̱ “Wiaa thiëcɛ Baal-dhɛ-bub kuoth ji̱ Ɛk-ron, mi bä gɔaa kä juey ɛ mi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu jääk Kuɔth Nhial E-li-yaa raan Tic-be jiök i̱ “Jiɛc rɔ wër ro̱mni kɛ ja̱a̱k kua̱r Tha-mɛ-ria, kä jio̱k nikɛ i̱, ‘Ɛ ɣöö thilɛ Kuoth kä I-thɛ-rɛl mɔ wä yɛn thiec ni Baal-dhɛ-bub kuoth Ɛk-ron ɔ?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ täämɛ nɛmɛ laarɛ Kuoth Nhial i̱, ‘/Ci rɔ̱ bi jiɛc dhaŋä mɔ ti̱i̱ thi̱n ɔ, ɛ ni ɣöö bi li̱w ɛ thuɔ̱k.’ ” Kä cu E-li-yaa wä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ja̱a̱k loc kä kuäär, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛŋu cia rɔ riet jɔk ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Tëë kɛ wut mi ci ben röm kɛ nɛy, kä cɛ nɛy jiök i̱, ‘Luɔcɛ kä kuäär in jäk yɛ, kä la̱rɛ jɛ i̱ ɛ Kuoth Nhial i̱ ɛ thil Kuɔth kä I-thɛ-rɛl mɔ jäki naath ɔ wa Baal-dhɛ-bub kuoth ji̱ Ɛk-ron thiec ɔ? Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ /ci rɔ bi jiɛc wi̱i̱ dhaŋä mɔ ti̱i̱ thi̱n ɔ, ɛni ɣöö bi li̱w kɛ thuɔ̱k.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär kɛ thiec i̱, “Kä ɛ ram mi tëë di ci röm kɛ yɛ mɔ kä ci yɛ la̱t ti̱ti̱?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ram mi ciɛŋ ni bi̱i̱ mieem, kä te lɛdɛ kɛ la̱a̱k gupä.” Kä cu kuäär wee, “Ɛ E-li-yaa raan Tic-be.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ɛ jäk kä rɛm mi̱ jiɛn dhieec kɛ bo̱o̱thdiɛn. Kä cuɛ wä kä E-li-yaa, kä E-li-yaa tëë nyuurä nhial wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m, kä cuɛ jiök i̱, “Raan Kuɔth, ji̱ Ɛ kuäär i̱, ‘Bër piny.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu E-li-yaa jɛ loc i̱, “Mi ɛ ɣän raan Kuɔth, ɛ mac bëë piny nhial mi bi ji̱ pɛt yɛnɛ nɛɛku.” Kä cu mac ben piny nhial kä cuɛ jɛ waŋ kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär bo̱o̱th nyɔk kɛ jäkni kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ ti jiɛn dhieec. Kä cuɛ ben kä E-li-yaa, kä cuɛ jiök i̱, “Raan Kuɔth, laar kuäärɛ i̱, ‘Bër piny kɛ pɛ̈th.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu E-li-yaa jɛ loc i̱, “Mi ɛ ɣän raan Kuɔth, ɛ mac bëë piny nhial bɛ ji̱ ben pɛt yɛnɛ nɛɛku.” Kä cu mac Kuɔth ben piny nhial kä cuɛ ben waŋ kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär bo̱o̱th in diɔ̱ɔ̱kdiɛn nyɔk kɛ jäkni kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ ti jiɛn dhieec. Kä cuɛ rɔ ben ka̱m mua̱a̱l nhiam E-li-yaa, kä cuɛ wee “Raan Kuɔth, la̱ŋä ni ji̱, kɛ tëkdä kɛnɛ tëk nɛɛni ti̱ti̱, akɛ gɔw waaŋdu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛnɛ, ci mac ben piny nhial kä cɛ bööth rɛmni da̱ŋ rɛw waŋ kɛ rɛmkiɛn ti jiɛn dhieec kɛɛl. Kä täämɛ a tëkdä gɔaa waaŋdu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk Kuɔth Nhial E-li-yaa jiök i̱, “Wiaa kɛɛl yɛnɛ jɛ. Cu dual kɛ jɛ.” Kä cu E-li-yaa wä kɛɛl kɛ jɛ kä kuäär, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kuäär jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ laarɛ Kuoth Nhial i̱, ‘Kɛ ɣöö ci naath ja̱k wa Baal-dhɛ-bub, kuoth ji̱ Ɛk-ron thiec (kuɛ la ɣöö thilɛ Kuoth kä I-thɛ-rɛl mi dëë ruacdɛ thiec?) kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ /ci rɔ bi jiɛc wi̱i̱ dhaŋä mɔ ti̱i̱ thi̱n ɔ, ɛ ni ɣöö bi li̱w ɛ thuɔ̱k.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ li̱w ce̱tnikɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial in ca lat ɛ E-li-yaa. Kä cu Yo-ram a kuäär kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ kɛ rɛw runä ruec Yo-ram gat Yo-ca-pat, kuäär Juda, kɛ ɣöö thilɛ Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa gat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätni Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
